sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant USER as 用户
    participant FRONT as 前端<br/>ScenePlay.vue
    participant CTRL as 控制器<br/>MiniGameController
    participant SESSION as 会话服务<br/>SessionService
    participant INTENT as 意图分析<br/>intentAnalyzer
    participant STORY as 剧情生成<br/>Storyboard Agent
    participant TASK as 任务服务<br/>FreeChapterTaskService
    participant PROGRESS as 进度引擎<br/>TaskProgressEngine
    participant AI as AI 模型调用<br/>text/index.ts

    %% 正常对话流程
    USER->>FRONT: 发送消息
    FRONT->>FRONT: 消息预处理
    FRONT->>CTRL: POST /session/continue
    
    CTRL->>INTENT: analyzeIntent(ctx)
    INTENT->>INTENT: 规则预检
    INTENT->>AI: callAiModel()
    AI-->>INTENT: 返回意图结果
    
    INTENT-->>CTRL: IntentResult
    
    CTRL->>CTRL: 分流调度
    CTRL->>SESSION: continueSessionNarrative()
    
    SESSION->>STORY: generateNarrative()
    STORY->>AI: callAiModel('storyboard')
    AI-->>STORY: 剧情内容
    
    STORY-->>SESSION: NarrativeResult
    SESSION->>PROGRESS: evaluate()
    PROGRESS-->>SESSION: TaskProgressResult
    
    SESSION-->>CTRL: SessionResult
    CTRL-->>FRONT: 返回渲染数据
    FRONT-->>USER: 显示剧情+选项

    %% 创建任务流程
    Note over USER,CTRL: 创建任务流程 (intent: create_task)
    USER->>FRONT: #开任务
    FRONT->>CTRL: POST /session/continue
    CTRL->>INTENT: analyzeIntent()
    INTENT-->>CTRL: intent: create_task
    CTRL->>TASK: generateFreeChapterTaskBlueprintByAi()
    TASK->>AI: 生成任务蓝图
    AI-->>TASK: TaskBlueprint
    TASK-->>CTRL: 任务实例
    CTRL-->>FRONT: 任务面板数据
    FRONT-->>USER: 显示任务卡片

    %% 退出任务流程
    Note over USER,CTRL: 退出任务流程 (intent: exit_task)
    USER->>FRONT: #退出
    FRONT->>CTRL: POST /session/continue
    CTRL->>INTENT: analyzeIntent()
    INTENT-->>CTRL: intent: exit_task
    CTRL->>TASK: abandonActiveFreeChapterTaskEvent()
    TASK-->>CTRL: 任务已放弃
    CTRL-->>FRONT: 返回主剧情
    FRONT-->>USER: 显示放弃剧情

    %% 查询进度流程
    Note over USER,CTRL: 查询进度流程 (intent: query_progress)
    USER->>FRONT: #任务
    FRONT->>CTRL: POST /session/continue
    CTRL->>PROGRESS: evaluate()
    PROGRESS->>PROGRESS: 静态检查 → 规则评估 → AI评估
    PROGRESS-->>CTRL: TaskProgressResult
    CTRL-->>FRONT: 进度报告
    FRONT-->>USER: 显示进度面板
